		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A sticky firearm round that mires an area.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions · Requires Firearm.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3. The area becomes Slowed Terrain for 1 minute or until dispersed. Creatures that start or end their turn in the area must make a STR save or be Restrained.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Targets that leave the area are still Slowed, 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on Grapple (STR) saves.</p><hr><p><em>[M] Gadget activation costs 1 Toolbelt scrap (2 total for the Toolbelt upgrade); the passive is always active. Scrap cost and activation are tracked by the module.</em></p>",
